        "## Problem Definition\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Business problem: Predict wheather a customer will make a transaction,"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8dxCG4-iE66v"
      },
      "id": "8dxCG4-iE66v"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Data Science problem: This supervised learining and classification problem. I will use the Gaussian Naive Bayes model\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wMSQX2ktDHEL"
      },
